around them."},"1173":{"id":"/docs/components/select-34","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#custom-option","content":"**A composed interior.** Pass Antares components (`Label`, `Group`, `Button`, `SelectValue`, `Popover`,\n`Content`, `ListBox`, `Text`, `FieldError`) and Select renders them as-is instead of its default layout.\n`SelectValue` displays the current selection inside a `Button variant=\"trigger\"`."},"1174":{"id":"/docs/components/select-35","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#custom-option","content":"**A function returning that interior.** Use this when the interior needs the Select state: it receives\n`isOpen`, `isInvalid`, and the rest of the render props."},"1175":{"id":"/docs/components/select-36","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#custom-option","content":"Select recognizes a composed interior by seeing one of those components as a direct child. If you\nwrap them in your own component or an element, use the function form so there is nothing to detect."},"1176":{"id":"/docs/components/select-37","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#custom-option","content":"Use `variant=\"control\"` when Select shares a `Group` owned by another field, such as a currency Select\ninside a TextField. This explicitly omits Select's own field shell. The default variant renders a complete field."},"1177":{"id":"/docs/components/select-38","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#custom-option","content":"Option components may wrap `SelectItem`. Select passes unrecognized children to its ListBox, whose collection\nbuilder resolves the wrapped items."},"1178":{"id":"/docs/components/select-39","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#props","content":"The `Select` component accepts the following props:"},"1179":{"id":"/docs/components/structure","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","type":"page","content":"Structure primitives","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/structure"},"1180":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-0","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/structure","content":"Generic structural containers for composing a component's interior."},"1181":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-1","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/structure#hybrid-styling","content":"Hybrid styling"},"1182":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-2","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/structure#examples","content":"Examples"},"1183":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-3","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/structure#default","content":"Default"},"1184":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-4","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/structure#group","content":"Group"},"1185":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-5","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/structure#props","content":"Props"},"1186":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-6","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/structure#content","content":"Content"},"1187":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-7","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/structure#header","content":"Header"},"1188":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-8","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/structure#footer","content":"Footer"},"1189":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-9","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/structure#buttongroup","content":"ButtonGroup"},"1190":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-10","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/structure#group-1","content":"Group"},"1191":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-11","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/structure","content":"**Shared structural containers.** These generic, layout-only components are the building blocks for composing a component's interior (a `Modal`, a card, a panel). They are semantic containers built on `Flex`, so they accept the same layout props (`direction`, `gap`, `alignItems`, `justifyContent`, `padding`, ...)."},"1192":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-12","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/structure","content":"**`Content`** — the primary body region (a `<section>`, a column that grows to fill)."},"1193":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-13","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/structure","content":"**`Header`** — the top region: title area and optional trailing close (a `<header>` row that spaces its contents apart)."},"1194":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-14","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/structure","content":"**`Footer`** — the bottom region: secondary content and/or actions (a `<footer>` row that spaces its contents apart)."},"1195":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-15","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/structure","content":"**`ButtonGroup`** — a cluster of related actions, typically inside a `Footer` (an end-aligned, wrapping row with `role=\"group\"`)."},"1196":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-16","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/structure","content":"**`Group`** — the boxed row for field controls (`Input`, `TextArea`, `Button variant=\"control\"`). Layout defaults only; Field injects chrome via `GroupContext`. Size is `size=\"sm\" | \"md\"`."},"1197":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-17","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/structure#hybrid-styling","content":"Each container works in two modes:"},"1198":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-18","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/structure#hybrid-styling","content":"**Standalone** — with no parent context it renders with its own structural defaults and looks the same everywhere."},"1199":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-19","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/structure#hybrid-styling","content":"**Adopted** — placed inside a parent that provides its context (`ContentContext`, `HeaderContext`, `FooterContext`, `ButtonGroupContext`), it picks up that parent's styling and spacing automatically. Merge precedence is defaults \\< parent context \\< consumer props (`className` concatenates, handlers chain), via React Aria's `useContextProps`."},"1200":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-20","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/structure#hybrid-styling","content":"A parent adopts them by providing the contexts around its children:"},"1201":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-21","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/structure#default","content":"The shared structural containers composed together into a card-like layout. Each is a\nplain semantic region here; inside a parent that provides their contexts (e.g. `Modal`)\nthey adopt that parent's spacing automatically."},"1202":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-22","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/structure#group","content":"Group is the bordered field box. Size and invalid/disabled chrome apply here."},"1203":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-23","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/structure#props","content":"`Content`, `Header`, `Footer`, and `ButtonGroup` each accept all `Flex` layout props."},"1204":{"id":"/docs/components/switch","page_id":"/docs/components/switch","type":"page","content":"Switch","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/switch"},"1205":{"id":"/docs/components/switch-0","page_id":"/docs/components/switch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/switch","content":"A binary toggle control that switches a setting between on and off states, communicated via the WAI-ARIA switch role."},"1206":{"id":"/docs/components/switch-1","page_id":"/docs/components/switch","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/switch#features","content":"Features"},"1207":{"id":"/docs/components/switch-2","page_id":"/docs/components/switch","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/switch#installation","content":"Installation"},"1208":{"id":"/docs/components/switch-3","page_id":"/docs/components/switch","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/switch#examples","content":"Examples"},"1209":{"id":"/docs/components/switch-4","page_id":"/docs/components/switch","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/switch#default","content":"Default"},"1210":{"id":"/docs/components/switch-5","page_id":"/docs/components/switch","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/switch#switch-selected","content":"Switch Selected"},"1211":{"id":"/docs/components/switch-6","page_id":"/docs/components/switch","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/switch#switch-sizes","content":"Switch Sizes"},"1212":{"id":"/docs/components/switch-7","page_id":"/docs/components/switch","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/switch#switch-label-position","content":"Switch Label Position"},"1213":{"id":"/docs/components/switch-8","page_id":"/docs/componen